#QLCIR-G1
# name: interferometer_grouped_k5_s2_d3
# family: physics/grouped-interferometer
# expected: SAT
# physical: Abstract multi-slit/interferometer coarse-graining; only proposition structure is encoded, not amplitudes or phases.
# note: 5-path event coarse-grained into groups of 2 and 3 paths; psi belongs to the total event but is not classically reconstructed from the two coarse pieces.
dim(3)
output(8)
1 = or(path0, path1)
2 = or(path2, path3, path4)
3 = or(1, 2)
4 = and(psi, 1)
5 = and(psi, 2)
6 = or(4, 5)
7 = not(6)
8 = and(psi, 3, 7)
